        {
          "title": "Why RAG and the Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What RAG Is",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==RAG== = retrieve text at query time, add it to the prompt",
                "Model stays {blue:frozen}; knowledge lives {green:outside} it",
                "Gap 1: {red:stale} knowledge (training cutoff)",
                "Gap 2: {red:private} data it never saw",
                "Gap 3: hallucination with {red:no source} to check"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Two Pipelines",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "title": "Offline: indexing",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Ingest",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Chunk",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Embed",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Index",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "title": "Online: query",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Embed query",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Retrieve",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Rerank",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Assemble prompt",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Generate + cite",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Pick the Tool",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "RAG",
                "Fine-tuning",
                "Long context"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Best for",
                  "**Fresh or private** facts, citations",
                  "Style, format, behaviour",
                  "**Small, static** corpus"
                ],
                [
                  "Cost per query",
                  "Low",
                  "Low",
                  "{red:High}"
                ],
                [
                  "Weak spot",
                  "Retrieval misses",
                  "Facts go stale",
                  "Recall drops in the ==middle=="
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Fine-tune the **behaviour**, retrieve the **facts**."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why not fine-tune facts?** They go stale, give no citations, and cost a retrain to update",
                "**Two pipelines?** Offline indexing; online query",
                "**Skip RAG when?** The corpus is small and static, so it fits in context"
              ],
              "style": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
