              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Embeddings",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Embedding model: text → ==fixed-length vector==, similar meaning lands close",
                "Compare by ==cosine== or dot product; equal when **normalised**",
                "{red:Same model} for chunks and queries",
                "Model change → ==re-embed corpus==",
                "Check **max input tokens**: no silent truncation"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Search and ANN",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==ANN== trades a little recall for speed"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
