            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Store beside vector",
              "text": "Keep ==chunk text== and **metadata** next to each vector."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Same model?** Different models, different spaces: distances mean nothing",
                "**HNSW?** Graph hops skip most vectors: faster, may miss a true neighbour",
                "**Flat enough?** Small corpus: an O(N) scan is fast"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
