          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Search and Fusion",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Embed the query, fetch ==top-k== chunks (k often 5-20)",
                "==Similarity threshold== drops weak matches",
                "{blue:Dense} = meaning; {green:BM25} = IDs, names, error codes",
                "Merge both lists with ==RRF==: score = Σ 1/(60 + rank)"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Rerank",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Top 50",
                    "sub": "bi-encoder, fast",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Rescore",
                    "sub": "cross-encoder",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Top 5",
                    "sub": "precise",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Bi-encoder",
                "Cross-encoder"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Reads",
                  "query, chunk apart",
                  "query + chunk together"
                ],
                [
                  "Latency",
                  "low",
                  "higher"
                ],
                [
                  "Precision",
                  "lower",
                  "higher"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Filters and Rewriting",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Metadata filters at query time: tenant, date, doc type, permissions",
                "Query rewriting and ==HyDE== help vague or multi-turn questions"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "ACL in retrieval",
              "text": "Filter **before** the prompt so users never see forbidden chunks."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why BM25 plus vectors?** Vectors miss exact IDs; BM25 misses meaning.",
                "**Cross-encoder edge?** Reads query and chunk jointly, so scores are sharper.",
                "**Measure quality?** ==recall@k== (right chunk in top-k), ==MRR== (mean of 1/rank of the first right chunk)."
              ],
              "style": "check"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
