              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes and Evaluation",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Chunks too large or too small",
                "No reranking",
                "Stuffing too much context",
                "No refusal rule",
                "Index not versioned",
                "Never evaluating"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Evaluate separately",
              "text": "Retrieval: ==recall@k==. Generation: ==faithfulness== and answer relevance."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Stop answers beyond context?** Answer-only rule plus \"I don't know\"",
                "**Verify citations?** Every cited ID must be in the retrieved set",
                "**Wrong answers?** Check retrieval first, then generation"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
