              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Quality Checklist",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Hybrid search== + ==reranker==",
                "Metadata and ACL filters",
                "Refusal instruction, verified citations",
                "Index versioning",
                "Eval set: ==recall@k==, ==faithfulness=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**60 seconds:** index the docs offline; online embed, retrieve, rerank, prompt, cite",
                "**Top 3 levers:** ==hybrid search==, ==reranking==, ==chunking==",
                "**Fresh index:** re-ingest and re-embed changed docs by ==doc ID==, delete removed ones",
                "**Model change:** bump the ==index version==, re-embed everything"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
